{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfying the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\">equation</a>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/f/b1f9a6fab0114e3347f2b17beae5ddf4474e64db.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac {2x^2 - 10x}{x^2 - 5x} = x - 3\\]\" width=\"145\" height=\"38\" />\nis:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/7/f47917092a10a2b61d16543b2672bfd068eae5f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ \\text{zero} \\qquad \\text{(B)} \\ \\text{one} \\qquad \\text{(C)} \\ \\text{two} \\qquad \\text{(D)} \\ \\text{three} \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ \\text{an integer greater than 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"583\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77f0e6708ec6ef2b58d6905559c5f7937a5a08ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 5x$\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" /> is in the denominator, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/0/f605f29be99284afbcc2c7794fc14f58af52d461.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq 0,5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" />. Simplifying,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/9/38946a851cb0e4cdf00a8952baab5f8c69d2eabf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\left(\\frac{x^2 - 5}{x^2 - 5}\\right) = 2 = x-3\\]\" width=\"189\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, which isn't in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Domain\" title=\"Domain\">domain</a> of the equation. Thus there are no values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/8/46894cfc69abe6eb580630a52f1e7ab81022ea5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/P